/E (We will continue to strive for archival excellence, building upon our strength as an institution with field-leading practice models, a commitment to broad and equitable access, and an investment in archival infrastructures. We will support our staff and manage our resources prudently to ensure that the Archive Center thrives as an organization.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 189 0 R
/E (The Rockefeller Archive Center works to create and expand communities of practice in the fields of archiving, philanthropic record-keeping, and the study of philanthropy. Institutions and individuals working in philanthropy and in scholarship operate with unusual degrees of autonomy; knowing that there is profound value in these pluralistic pursuits, we connect people and efforts to strengthen collective action. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
