916 0 obj
<<
/Title (Equitable: We want our collections, services, workplace culture, and facilities to empower and reflect the diverse communities we serve. We proactively dismantle barriers to access and recruitment while evolving our collecting, interpretive, and analytical activities to engage the communities impacted by our work. We design our processes, services, and systems to promote racial, gender, and economic justice, cultural competence, and to address the structural imbalances inherent in historical documentation.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 30 0 R
/Prev 818 0 R
/Next 819 0 R
>>
endobj
