/Title (At the Rockefeller Archive Center, we believe that philanthropy deserves the same level of thoughtful inquiry that governments and markets receive. Philanthropic institutions help determine which ideas are pursued, which problems receive attention, and which communities receive support. But how are those decisions made? Who sets the priorities? And what do we know about what has been effective and what has not?)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 814 0 R
/Prev 909 0 R
/Next 1030 0 R
>>
endobj
988 0 obj
