/Title (The Rockefeller Archive Center exists to help close those gaps. We preserve the historical record of philanthropy, make it available for independent research, advance archives and information management across the philanthropic sector, and support scholars and practitioners studying philanthropy's history and central and shared issues concerning contemporary practice.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 814 0 R
/Prev 1030 0 R
/Next 910 0 R
