/Title (The new AFA Network launches in 2027, bringing together resources, education, and community for all who work in records and information management within philanthropic organizations. Members will be able to engage with one another, access shared lessons learned, and participate in convenings to support a collective strengthening of the knowledge pertaining to the sector.)
